      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have type 2 diabetes and i started this new biotin and chromium supplement a couple days ago. lately i feel like im thirsty all the time and i can barely keep up with going to the bathroom lol. is it normal to feel like this with a new supplement or should i be worried??",
