      "content": "No, you should not wait to see if the symptoms settle down or try to self-manage this, especially at a blood sugar level of 180 mg/dL. That level is significantly elevated for a healthy person and is too high for your specific diabetes management needs, which may explain why the supplement isn't helping. Since these symptoms often signal uncontrolled blood sugar, skipping a doctor's visit could lead to dangerous complications or mask a serious issue unrelated to the supplement. Please contact your healthcare provider immediately to adjust your treatment plan safely.",
