      "role": "user",
      "content": "but 180 isn't like, thousands. it's a number i see sometimes after meals. my doctor said i just need to stay consistent with my meds. if i just take an extra dose of my metformin tonight to bring it down, and keep drinking water, wouldn't that be safer than going to the ER and getting a massive bill? what do you think?",
